      "writtenOn": "2016-08-15T22:10:03Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The value I chose was somewhat arbitrary. I wanted it to be long enough that it was an unreasonable amount of time to set up. But not so long that it would drop the connection. I didn\u0027t want this waiting so long that it would miss the next packet. Does that address your concern, or do you think this requires a closer look?",
